This is the real 42sh, built unmodified from
github.com/Polturgust/my-shell, running on a small Linux in your browser.
Other commands (ls, cat, grep, sort...) are BusyBox. Nothing is saved.

Try:  ls -la | grep txt               cat fruits.txt | grep b | wc -l
      echo hello > note.txt           cat < note.txt
      false || echo fallback          ls *.t?t
      alias ll ls -l                  ll
      setenv GREETING hi              env | grep GREETING
      echo `pwd`                      history

